 1937 and served the Axis forces throughout WWII.","LocalizedString":"The Junkers Ju 87 or Stuka, which is abbreviation of Sturzkampfflugzeug which is German for \"dive bomber\", was a German dive bomber and ground-attack aircraft. The aircraft was easily recognized by its inverted wings and undercarriage and the wailing sound of the Jericho-Trumpets when it made its dive. The Stuka was the main aircraft used for close air support in the Luftwaffe and was first used in combat in the Spanish Civil War in 1937 and served the Axis forces throughout WWII."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isInPermanentPool":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'au_stuka_attack_psby_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Bomber/Stuka/au_stuka_attack_psby_Cue.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion_Medium'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/Explosion_Medium.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/t_ju_87_stuka2.t_ju_87_stuka2","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/JU_87_STUKA.JU_87_STUKA","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":405.0},"historyPhotoSource":"German Federal Archive","historyPhotoIdentificationCode":"183-J16050 / CC-BY-SA","historyPhotoAuthor":"PK-Kriegsberichter Karnerth","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_ju_87_stuka_photo","SourceString":"German Junkers Ju 87D Stuka dive bombers, Yugoslavia, October 1943.","LocalizedString":"German Junkers Ju 87D Stuka dive bombers, Yugoslavia, October 1943."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_ju_87_stuka_header","SourceString":"Dive Bomber","LocalizedString":"Dive Bomber"},"blowUpExplosion":{"ObjectName":"ParticleSystem'P_ExplosionAircraftM'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Explosions/Medium/Aircraft/P_ExplosionAircra